  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Star Dictator — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have learned mass summoning. You can now maintain a number of Minor Star Shikigami equal to three times your proficiency bonus and can have two Major Star Shikigami active at once.<br />\n Additionally, the damage of your pseudo-domain increases to 1d10 slashing damage per shikigami orbiting and ignores immunity and resistance to slashing damage. The radius of your pseudo-domain increases to 10 ft x the number of orbiting shikigami.</p>",
